Port of topaz 0118/0121 (TopazModem.cpp, APSL 2.0) to bsd C: GLINK doorbell APCS bit 15, SMEM 0x86000000, TCSR mutex 3, 8 MiB pool at 0xb0800000, tftp from /usr/local/share/op5fw/modem, rmtfs from efs/*.img (writes kept in RAM), rmtfs buffer 2 MiB to HLOS+MSS_MSA. WLFW (W4) not ported: its arrival ends step 11 successfully.
